      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The GPU usage going DOWN when turning mirrors on seems like irregular behaviour, and it didn't used to do this. If anything you'd expect turning on a mirror to use MORE gpu power.\n\nNot to mention minus a GPU UPGRADE my system is entirely the same so I would've expected similar if not better mirror performance, not worse.",
